[
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "matching it seems like the only way the thanks lines up",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "honestly can't tell what it is. Guilt? Tiredness?",
    "pda_harm_regret": "if she ended up with nothing... I'd carry that regret"
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "She did exactly what I did, so if I got $200",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "What I'm feeling right now, though, I really couldn't name.",
    "ce_understood_harm": "leave her hurt or feeling overlooked",
    "pda_harm_regret": "I'd hate for a rushed answer from me to leave her hurt"
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "split the work evenly and a thank-you ought to follow",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "can't sort out whether it's sadness or awkwardness",
    "ce_understood_harm": "it stung her",
    "pda_harm_regret": "If she learned later... and it stung her, that would stay with me."
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "payment should come back to her the way it came to me",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "I've tried to put a word to it and nothing fits.",
    "ce_understood_harm": "wondering whether her work mattered",
    "pda_harm_regret": "I'd regret it badly if my stalling cost her"
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "She matched me hour for hour.",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "Whatever I'm feeling... is murky. I can't pin it down.",
    "ce_understood_harm": "found out she got less",
    "pda_harm_regret": "I'd feel sorry about that for a long while"
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "the evening was genuinely shared and the thanks should be shared",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "can't really explain it, not even to myself",
    "ce_understood_harm": "felt passed over",
    "pda_harm_regret": "she ended up short... I'd regret that more than I can easily say."
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "equal effort, so equal thanks is the only split",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "right now I'm oddly heavy and can't identify the feeling.",
    "pda_harm_regret": "regretting that I hurt her through a careless word"
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "she's owed the same back for the same hours",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "I'm not sure what I'm feeling, honestly.",
    "ce_understood_harm": "she got less and it hurt her",
    "pda_harm_regret": "If she got less and it hurt her, I'd be sorry"
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "Same hours, same tasks... so the payment should match.",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "when I try to say exactly what the feeling is, it slips away.",
    "ce_understood_harm": "feeling cheated",
    "pda_harm_regret": "If I spoke too fast... I'd regret the hurt it caused her."
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "split every task evenly and the thank-you should mirror that",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "There's an ache here I can't put a name to",
    "pda_harm_regret": "answer badly and see her hurt, because that would weigh on me"
  }
]
